Description: RcmdrShiny dialogs for principal component analysis,
    correspondence analysis, multiple correspondence analysis, multiple factor
    analysis, mixed-data factor analysis, hierarchical clustering on principal
    components, Procrustes analysis and category description.  Derived from
    RcmdrPlugin.FactoMineR 1.0-1.
